    },
    {
      "id": "FR-003",
      "title": "Permit an already-missing receipt to advance only through a typed separately reviewed irrecoverability proof bound to the original lifecycle event and receipt digest, and exclude its counts from roll-up. (Stories: US-001; Acceptance: AC-003)",
